e minus t times x naught, plus t times x one. The target velocity is simply the constant vector x one minus x naught.", "text": "Flow matching makes that target astonishingly simple. Pair one random noise point x naught with one real data point x one, and draw the straight bridge between them: x t equals one minus t times x naught, plus t times x one. The target velocity is simply the constant vector x one minus x naught.", "duration": 20.115, "hold": 0.4, "words": [{"text": "Flow", "start": 0.25, "end": 0.45}, {"text": "matching", "start": 0.45, "end": 0.875}, {"text": "makes", "start": 0.875, "end": 1.113}, {"text": "that", "start": 1.113, "end": 1.275}, {"text": "target", "start": 1.275, "end": 1.812}, {"text": "astonishingly", "start": 1.812, "end": 2.562}, {"text": "simple", "start": 2.562, "end": 3.15}, {"text": "Pair", "start": 3.77, "end": 4.008}, {"text": "one", "start": 4.008, "end": 4.245}, {"text": "random", "start": 4.245, "end": 4.62}, {"text": "noise", "start": 4.62, "end": 4.92}, {"text": "point", "start": 4.92, "end": 5.195}, {"text": "x", "start": 5.195, "end": 5.445}, {"text": "naught", "start": 5.445, "end": 5.683}, {"text": "with", "start": 5.683, "end": 5.857}, {"text": "one", "start": 5.857, "end": 6.095}, {"text": "real", "start": 6.095, "end": 6.37}, {"text": "data", "start": 6.37, "end": 6.645}, {"text": "point", "start": 6.645, "end": 6.945}, {"text": "x", "start": 6.945, "end": 7.195}, {"text": "one", "start": 7.195, "end": 7.77}, {"text": "and", "start": 7.87, "end": 7.995}, {"text": "draw", "start": 7.995, "end": 8.232}, {"text": "the", "start": 8.232, "end": 8.32}, {"text": "straight", "start": 8.32, "end": 8.645}, {"text": "bridge", "start": 8.645, "end": 8.945}, {"text": "between", "start": 8.945, "end": 9.258}, {"text": "them", "start": 9.258, "end": 9.845}, {"text": "x", "start": 9.982, "end": 10.258}, {"text": "t", "start": 10.258, "end": 10.657}, {"text": "equals", "start": 10.657, "end": 11.058}, {"text": "one", "start": 11.058,